```css
:root {
  /* Color definitions */
  --color-primary: #007acc;      /* bright blue */
  --color-secondary: #00bfa5;    /* teal */
  --color-accent: #ff6f00;       /* orange */
  --color-background: #f5f7fa;   /* light grayish blue */
  --color-text-primary: #1a1a1a; /* very dark gray */
  --color-text-secondary: #555555; /* medium gray */
  --color-hero-bg: #e1f0fb;      /* very light blue */
}

.hero {
  background-color: var(--color-hero-bg);
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  padding: 6rem 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 80vh;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 3rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: var(--color-primary);
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  max-width: 600px;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
}

.hero .btn-primary {
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
}

.hero .btn-primary:hover {
  background-color: var(--color-secondary);
}
```

