```css
:root {
  /* Color Palette */
  --color-primary: #007acc;      /* Bright Blue */
  --color-primary-dark: #005f99; /* Darker Blue */
  --color-secondary: #00bfa5;    /* Teal */
  --color-secondary-dark: #008f73; /* Dark Teal */
  --color-background: #f5f8fa;   /* Light Gray-Blue */
  --color-text: #1a1a1a;         /* Dark Gray */
  --color-accent: #ff6f00;       /* Orange */
  --color-accent-dark: #cc5600;  /* Dark Orange */
  --color-muted: #7a8a99;        /* Medium Gray */
}

.hero {
  background-color: var(--color-background);
  color: var(--color-text);
  padding: 6rem 2rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 80vh;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 3rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: var(--color-primary);
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  color: var(--color-muted);
}

.hero .btn-primary {
  background-color: var(--color-secondary);
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  padding: 1rem 2rem;
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: inline-block;
}

.hero .btn-primary:hover,
.hero .btn-primary:focus {
  background-color: var(--color-secondary-dark);
  outline: none;
}
```

