```css
:root {
  /* Color Palette */
  --color-primary: #007acc;    /* Bright Blue */
  --color-secondary: #00bfa5;  /* Teal */
  --color-accent: #ff6f00;     /* Orange */
  --color-background: #f5f7fa; /* Light Gray */
  --color-text: #222222;       /* Dark Charcoal */
  --color-muted: #666666;      /* Medium Gray */
  --color-white: #ffffff;      /* Pure White */
}

.hero {
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  color: var(--color-white);
  padding: 120px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 3.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto 40px;
  color: var(--color-white);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.hero .cta-button {
  background-color: var(--color-accent);
  color: var(--color-white);
  padding: 15px 40px;
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: inline-block;
}

.hero .cta-button:hover,
.hero .cta-button:focus {
  background-color: #e65c00; /* Darker Orange */
  outline: none;
}
```

