```css
:root {
  /* Color Palette */
  --color-primary: #00796b;       /* Teal */
  --color-secondary: #004d40;     /* Dark Teal */
  --color-accent: #c62828;        /* Deep Red */
  --color-background: #e0f2f1;    /* Light Aqua */
  --color-text-primary: #212121;  /* Dark Charcoal */
  --color-text-secondary: #555555;/* Medium Gray */
  --color-hero-bg: #b2dfdb;       /* Soft Aqua */
  --color-hero-overlay: rgba(0, 121, 107, 0.6); /* Semi-transparent Teal */
}

.hero-section {
  background-color: var(--color-hero-bg);
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  padding: 6rem 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-section::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background-color: var(--color-hero-overlay);
  z-index: 0;
}

.hero-section > * {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
}
```

