```css
:root {
  /* Color variables */
  --color-primary: #007BFF;       /* Blue */
  --color-secondary: #28A745;     /* Green */
  --color-accent: #FFC107;        /* Amber */
  --color-background: #F8F9FA;    /* Light gray */
  --color-text-primary: #212529;  /* Dark gray */
  --color-text-secondary: #6C757D;/* Medium gray */
  --color-hero-bg: #E9ECEF;       /* Soft off-white */
  --color-hero-overlay: rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.1); /* Semi-transparent blue for subtle overlay */
}

/* Hero section styles */
.hero {
  background-color: var(--color-hero-bg);
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  padding: 4rem 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  background-color: var(--color-hero-overlay);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}

.hero > * {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 3rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
}

.hero .btn-primary {
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 0.375rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
}

.hero .btn-primary:hover,
.hero .btn-primary:focus {
  background-color: #0056b3; /* Darker blue on hover/focus */
}
```

